                                "sense_id": "d409a721-2bcb-3463-a93f-0a50e280834e",
                                "text": "Dennis Anderson, 45, and Brandy Goldsbury, 46, were traveling from the beach in Lincoln City on the Oregon coast back to their home in Tigard around 8:30 p.m. July 13 when they spotted a black BMW 3 Series trying to pass them, according to reporting in The Oregonian."
                            },
