                                "sense_id": "d409a721-2bcb-3463-a93f-0a50e280834e",
                                "text": "“While the motivation for this has not been confirmed, we are aware that other Tesla dealerships have been targeted across Oregon and the nation for political reasons,” police in Tigard, Oregon, said in a statement."
                            }
                        ]
